WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 9=

01:48.700 --> 01:53.820
(Zizhi Tongjian)

01:59.980 --> 02:00.380
Come.

02:11.733 --> 02:12.420
You're here.

02:12.500 --> 02:13.780
Come. Sit.

02:16.300 --> 02:17.300
Here, have a seat.

02:20.260 --> 02:20.700
Sit.

02:21.933 --> 02:22.780
So, the question?

02:31.500 --> 02:31.940
Thanks.

02:32.580 --> 02:33.180
I'll do it.

03:01.220 --> 03:01.940
Get ready.

03:16.620 --> 03:17.060
Got it.

03:20.900 --> 03:21.540
First question.

03:21.933 --> 03:24.260
Regarding the iron wire
golden hook at the beginning,

03:24.333 --> 03:25.288
you remember it, right?

03:25.620 --> 03:26.222
I remember.

03:26.420 --> 03:27.100
The one

03:27.460 --> 03:29.100
taken off Zhang Laoba.

03:29.355 --> 03:30.577
Where's the golden hook?

03:31.180 --> 03:32.740
It should have been tied to the horse.

03:33.860 --> 03:35.420
It was fastened to the stirrup.

03:36.740 --> 03:38.060
Can that be used as a weapon?

03:38.355 --> 03:39.666
It can't be used as a weapon,

03:39.940 --> 03:41.400
but it can be used to pick a lock.

03:41.820 --> 03:43.260
The golden hook and the iron wire.

03:44.380 --> 03:45.288
That makes sense.

03:45.860 --> 03:46.500
Write it down.

03:46.700 --> 03:47.600
Readers will like it.

03:53.660 --> 03:54.060
So,

03:54.740 --> 03:56.466
when you were outlining the story,

03:56.511 --> 03:57.533
did you already think

03:57.577 --> 03:59.580
of using
the Long-Range Foreshadowing here?

03:59.820 --> 04:01.300
- No way.
- No way.

04:07.260 --> 04:09.060
When you run into a problem,
you solve it.

04:09.060 --> 04:10.911
When you get here
and realize there's no key,

04:10.920 --> 04:11.890
then you go back earlier

04:11.900 --> 04:14.060
and find something
that works like a key.

04:14.644 --> 04:16.700
But what if the iron wire
golden hook wasn't there,

04:17.220 --> 04:20.260
and earlier on, you never wrote that it
was fastened to the stirrup?

04:20.500 --> 04:20.940
Then what?

04:20.940 --> 04:22.488
Then you change it to something else.

04:22.980 --> 04:24.580
Solutions come from people.

04:24.580 --> 04:25.860
You've written so much earlier.

04:25.860 --> 04:27.780
Isn't it easy to dig around
and find a prop?

04:28.377 --> 04:29.300
Alright, that's enough.

04:29.540 --> 04:30.540
First question is done.

04:31.020 --> 04:31.888
Second one, continue.

04:31.977 --> 04:33.888
- The second is about killing...
- Wait...

04:33.940 --> 04:34.420
Ms. Lin,

04:35.100 --> 04:36.580
could you get us something to eat?

04:38.600 --> 04:39.577
What do you want to eat?

04:39.780 --> 04:40.780
No need to order delivery.

04:40.820 --> 04:42.270
Just go to the pastry shop downstairs.

04:42.288 --> 04:43.888
A quick trip saves the delivery fee.

04:49.420 --> 04:50.577
Solve the problem.

04:50.980 --> 04:52.620
Don't answer Mr. He's other questions.

04:53.460 --> 04:54.260
He's very busy.

04:56.100 --> 04:56.940
The second is

04:58.800 --> 05:00.666
about the enemy who killed his father.

05:06.820 --> 05:07.220
Yan,

05:07.555 --> 05:09.844
you know this industry
is highly competitive,

05:09.940 --> 05:10.380
right?

05:10.900 --> 05:12.340
I'm really thinking of you,

05:12.340 --> 05:13.777
and that's why I'm asking these.

05:14.180 --> 05:15.660
Besides you,

05:15.660 --> 05:17.222
has Ms. Lin signed anyone else?

05:17.980 --> 05:19.700
She only manages me personally.

05:19.940 --> 05:21.300
Good, that's good.

05:21.540 --> 05:22.500
Then I can rest assured.

05:23.060 --> 05:24.060
With your writing,

05:24.060 --> 05:25.460
I'd personally manage you, too.

05:26.660 --> 05:27.700
She really treats me well.

05:27.980 --> 05:29.540
Where do you usually stay?

05:29.700 --> 05:31.555
You don't eat delivery
all the time, do you?

05:31.622 --> 05:32.822
I stay at an internet cafe.

05:33.100 --> 05:34.580
When it's just me, I order delivery.

05:34.980 --> 05:36.700
But when Ms. Lin comes to see me,

05:36.860 --> 05:37.900
she brings me food.

05:39.300 --> 05:40.140
That's good.

05:40.260 --> 05:41.580
This kind of mental work

05:41.580 --> 05:42.460
takes a lot out of you.

05:42.460 --> 05:43.860
Balanced nutrition is important.

05:59.700 --> 06:00.820
(Delivery)

06:00.820 --> 06:02.620
When you discuss the story,
is it just the two of you?

06:02.620 --> 06:03.755
You talk at your place?

06:04.466 --> 06:05.666
Just the two of you?

06:05.900 --> 06:06.180
Yes.

06:06.311 --> 06:07.622
You talk late into the night?

06:08.700 --> 06:10.620
Usually one or two in the morning.

06:10.620 --> 06:12.540
That's too late.

06:12.866 --> 06:14.020
It's bad for your health.

06:14.020 --> 06:15.220
You can't stay up all the time.

06:15.644 --> 06:17.266
Don't you have a girlfriend?

06:17.580 --> 06:17.900
I...

06:19.780 --> 06:20.900
Exactly.

06:21.060 --> 06:23.500
So the killer can't be revealed yet.

06:24.020 --> 06:25.660
Luckily, we've kept it well hidden.

06:26.660 --> 06:27.540
You're back already?

06:28.000 --> 06:29.377
We have to wait for the next batch.

06:29.422 --> 06:30.210
They'll bring it up later.

06:30.220 --> 06:30.540
Okay.

06:30.620 --> 06:31.666
How's the discussion going?

06:31.711 --> 06:33.490
Second question,
the enemy who killed his father.

06:33.500 --> 06:35.311
The enemy who killed his father. Go on.

06:35.666 --> 06:36.940
You can't reveal him this early.

06:37.140 --> 06:39.180
If you reveal him now,
won't your story be over?

06:39.260 --> 06:40.377
Don't you think I'm right?

06:51.300 --> 06:51.700
Look,

06:52.100 --> 06:53.711
on your character relationship chart,

06:54.155 --> 06:56.140
it says the protagonist
currently has no clues

06:56.140 --> 06:57.577
to find the enemy who killed his father.

06:57.580 --> 06:59.900
Even if he could,
with his current level of strength,

06:59.900 --> 07:02.060
he couldn't take
on the entire group of villain bosses.

07:02.133 --> 07:03.533
Then what should he do?

07:03.980 --> 07:04.860
Rely on external help.

07:14.260 --> 07:15.700
What is this you're writing?

07:15.860 --> 07:17.740
This part is messy.

07:17.740 --> 07:18.100
Look,

07:18.220 --> 07:18.900
what is this?

07:18.900 --> 07:20.620
There's a structural problem.

07:20.620 --> 07:22.300
No, I revised it based on what you said.

07:22.460 --> 07:24.060
That's not what I meant.

07:24.060 --> 07:25.980
What I mean is,
you can move from here, right?

07:26.111 --> 07:26.980
Then here, you can...

07:27.060 --> 07:28.977
Right now, this part
is already repetitive.

07:29.044 --> 07:31.044
It makes people
think something went wrong.

07:32.820 --> 07:36.260
♪Yet no one will ever know♪

07:38.540 --> 07:41.860
♪For long time♪

07:46.244 --> 07:47.380
In short, he needs to win over

07:47.540 --> 07:49.488
everyone around him
and all available resources.

07:49.580 --> 07:50.380
By forming a team,

07:50.580 --> 07:51.900
he can achieve his revenge.

07:55.180 --> 07:58.260
♪Calling my name in the air♪

08:00.500 --> 08:04.220
♪Stay with open arms♪

08:06.377 --> 08:08.180
If you sell this place,
where will you live?

08:09.140 --> 08:10.060
I'll rent somewhere.

08:16.140 --> 08:17.380
I think you should find a lawyer

08:17.380 --> 08:18.340
and ask properly about

08:18.860 --> 08:21.400
your seven-million-yuan investment
to Ling Yikai and your company,

08:21.500 --> 08:23.066
what your rights and obligations are,

08:23.460 --> 08:25.300
and how to best protect your interests.

08:26.260 --> 08:26.860
I will.

08:27.780 --> 08:29.020
But the problem now is,

08:29.220 --> 08:30.955
this place won't sell for seven million.

08:31.340 --> 08:33.060
I estimate around 6.3 to 6.4 million.

08:33.711 --> 08:35.311
I'm still short by 600,000.

08:35.580 --> 08:37.177
Then just give him 600,000 less.

08:39.311 --> 08:40.844
I want to borrow 600,000 from you.

08:41.180 --> 08:42.740
I'm not exactly rich.

08:43.340 --> 08:44.660
I spend all my money on myself.

08:47.733 --> 08:49.844
Only when I need to borrow money
do I realize

08:49.860 --> 08:51.140
I don't really have many friends.

08:57.820 --> 08:58.380
Fine.

08:59.380 --> 09:00.600
I'll transfer it to you later.

09:01.340 --> 09:02.340
But I suggest you

09:02.780 --> 09:04.220
think it through carefully

09:04.380 --> 09:05.460
before you sell this place.

09:06.660 --> 09:07.380
The harder it is,

09:07.380 --> 09:09.100
the less you should
leave yourself a way out.

09:09.140 --> 09:10.888
Don't give yourself
the chance to back down.

09:11.266 --> 09:12.977
Then you'll move forward
without hesitation.

09:13.020 --> 09:14.822
And it saves you
the time of second-guessing.

09:15.111 --> 09:17.022
Hesitation is the most pointless thing.

09:25.900 --> 09:29.180
(Call. Lawyer Bei Wenqi)

09:38.020 --> 09:40.620
The number you have dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

09:41.020 --> 09:42.540
Please try again later.

09:47.660 --> 09:49.820
By the way, there's one more thing
I'd like to ask you.

09:51.980 --> 09:53.620
Your home decor looks pretty good.

09:54.777 --> 09:56.733
Well, I paid for it,
so of course, it looks good.

09:57.177 --> 09:58.733
Can you lend it to me for a few days?

09:59.377 --> 10:00.940
People are coming to view the place.

10:01.220 --> 10:02.620
If the place looks better,

10:02.688 --> 10:04.400
I can raise the price by
fifty to a hundred thousand.

10:04.500 --> 10:05.977
I'll return everything afterward.

10:06.820 --> 10:08.260
As expected of you, Zhao Lanxin.

10:08.260 --> 10:09.180
So meticulous.

10:10.311 --> 10:11.900
Do you want me to go talk to Ling Yikai?

10:12.580 --> 10:14.180
He should know what you've done for him.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.340
You want to see him

10:16.500 --> 10:17.580
just to show off

10:17.580 --> 10:18.660
your importance in his eyes.

10:19.300 --> 10:20.244
I don't need that.

10:21.066 --> 10:22.688
No wonder you don't have friends.

10:28.780 --> 10:30.100
Before I move my things in,

10:31.740 --> 10:32.700
repaint the walls.

10:40.220 --> 10:42.860
The number you have dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

10:43.220 --> 10:44.700
Please try again later.

10:51.900 --> 10:54.660
(Call. Lawyer Bei Wenqi's Office)

10:55.860 --> 10:57.340
Hello, Lawyer Bei's office.

10:57.460 --> 10:59.660
Lawyer Bei is not in right now.
How can I help you?

10:59.700 --> 11:00.755
Has he gotten off work?

11:01.100 --> 11:02.420
Sorry, I'm not sure.

11:52.700 --> 12:00.700
(Are you home? Want to come down
and see my new shoes?)

12:00.700 --> 12:02.100
(Lawyer Bei Wenqi)

12:30.140 --> 12:31.980
(Zhang Yousen)

12:35.940 --> 12:36.340
Hello.

12:36.860 --> 12:37.220
Hello.

12:37.860 --> 12:38.780
Your mom

12:38.900 --> 12:40.355
threw your shoes out with the trash.

12:40.400 --> 12:41.533
I picked them up for you.

12:41.580 --> 12:42.100
Are you home?

13:04.100 --> 13:05.700
(Lawyer Bei Wenqi)

13:08.860 --> 13:09.380
Hello.

13:09.820 --> 13:11.820
The number you
have dialed is powered off.

13:12.020 --> 13:13.260
Please try again later.

13:20.140 --> 13:22.620
The number you have dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

13:23.300 --> 13:24.540
Please try again later.

14:01.220 --> 14:02.088
You're still here.

14:02.422 --> 14:04.250
I was worried
you might not be feeling well.

14:09.300 --> 14:09.820
Come on in.

14:18.180 --> 14:18.740
Sit there.

14:19.140 --> 14:19.820
Do me a favor.

14:24.260 --> 14:25.300
Do you use Jixian?

14:27.140 --> 14:27.500
Yes.

14:37.060 --> 14:38.380
Help me sell these shoes.

14:39.500 --> 14:41.220
I'll treat you to a meal with the money.

14:42.260 --> 14:43.220
These are all new?

14:43.466 --> 14:44.711
None of them has been worn?

14:46.340 --> 14:47.620
Only this pair was worn once.

14:47.620 --> 14:48.666
The rest are brand new.

14:48.740 --> 14:49.740
You can add remarks.

15:27.380 --> 15:28.460
Why didn't you wear them?

15:31.540 --> 15:32.300
They were gifts.

15:34.600 --> 15:35.660
Who gave them to you?

15:36.100 --> 15:36.660
My boyfriend.

15:45.980 --> 15:47.000
You have a boyfriend?

15:47.900 --> 15:48.660
Not anymore.

15:50.220 --> 15:51.511
Your boyfriend must be rich.

15:52.780 --> 15:53.500
I mean your ex.

15:53.888 --> 15:55.866
He bought you so many expensive shoes.

15:56.180 --> 15:56.860
Yes, he is rich.

16:00.500 --> 16:01.777
Then, why did you break up?

16:04.200 --> 16:05.377
He's afraid of his wife.

16:10.820 --> 16:12.620
I told you before,
I'm not a good person.

16:18.200 --> 16:19.300
Now that you've broken up,

16:19.500 --> 16:20.555
it doesn't matter anymore.

16:22.420 --> 16:23.711
How much can these sell for?

16:25.780 --> 16:26.820
On Jixian,

16:27.140 --> 16:28.180
if they all find buyers,

16:29.044 --> 16:30.444
maybe thirty to forty thousand.

16:30.820 --> 16:32.100
Thirty to forty thousand...

16:33.311 --> 16:34.622
Breakup compensation, I guess.

16:37.580 --> 16:39.500
Does a guy have to buy
many expensive shoes

16:39.740 --> 16:40.980
to be your boyfriend?

16:41.180 --> 16:41.740
No.

16:42.180 --> 16:43.300
I can earn my own money.

16:48.533 --> 16:50.666
Then, what does it take
to be your boyfriend?

16:54.020 --> 16:54.460
Love me.

16:54.933 --> 16:56.244
What counts as loving you?

16:56.660 --> 16:57.888
Give up everything for me.

17:01.500 --> 17:02.700
You want to say you can, right?

17:04.266 --> 17:06.044
That's because you have nothing yet.

17:07.660 --> 17:09.380
I will become the best lawyer.

17:11.622 --> 17:12.866
Then, we'll talk about it later.

17:34.620 --> 17:37.740
(New Rising Youth Literary Editor Award,
Ms. Lin Zhanqiao)

17:39.260 --> 17:41.180
I got you a new toothbrush and a towel.

17:41.740 --> 17:42.860
I don't stay here much,

17:42.860 --> 17:44.260
so take care of yourself.

17:44.860 --> 17:46.100
If you run into problems,

17:46.100 --> 17:47.600
try to handle them on your own first.

17:47.620 --> 17:47.860
Okay.

17:47.860 --> 17:49.420
If you really can't, then come to me.

17:49.820 --> 17:50.140
Right.

17:50.340 --> 17:50.980
Also,

17:51.380 --> 17:52.940
a close friend of mine often stays here.

17:53.100 --> 17:54.311
You can go to her if needed.

17:54.620 --> 17:55.180
Ms. Lin,

17:56.580 --> 17:57.020
um,

17:57.620 --> 17:59.140
is that written by He Han?

18:00.111 --> 18:01.460
That's Shattered Six States.

18:01.540 --> 18:02.940
Back in the early planning stage,

18:02.940 --> 18:04.180
for things like character notes

18:04.180 --> 18:05.020
and the story outline,

18:05.140 --> 18:06.260
he wrote several versions.

18:06.400 --> 18:08.044
Can I take a look and learn from them?

18:08.100 --> 18:08.580
Sure.

18:09.620 --> 18:10.060
Ms. Lin,

18:10.244 --> 18:11.511
how did you collect so many

18:11.520 --> 18:13.820
limited editions and merchandise
of the Phantom Knight?

18:13.860 --> 18:14.900
Are you a fan, too?

18:15.400 --> 18:18.266
In the online fiction world, everyone
likes the Phantom Knight, right?

18:18.660 --> 18:19.460
I think so.

18:20.780 --> 18:21.900
You're in the industry,

18:21.900 --> 18:23.640
and you still don't know
who he really is?

18:23.740 --> 18:24.844
Yeah, I don't know.

18:25.500 --> 18:27.220
Back then,
there was no real name system.

18:27.740 --> 18:29.420
Even now, with that,

18:29.711 --> 18:31.780
if an author doesn't want
to reveal their identity,

18:32.100 --> 18:33.140
the editor and the company

18:33.140 --> 18:35.155
are still responsible
for keeping it confidential.

18:35.460 --> 18:37.740
Do you know
why he stopped writing later?

18:40.860 --> 18:41.340
No.

18:45.380 --> 18:47.260
This might interest you more.

18:48.340 --> 18:50.020
He Han's documentary footage.

18:50.380 --> 18:51.820
When he first became famous,

18:52.180 --> 18:54.260
someone wanted to make
a documentary about him,

18:54.260 --> 18:55.820
about his life and writing.

18:56.620 --> 18:58.300
But he felt it
portrayed him too ideally,

18:58.300 --> 18:59.577
so he didn't allow it to be released.

18:59.580 --> 19:00.933
But the footage was kept.

19:01.500 --> 19:02.380
Okay.

19:02.900 --> 19:03.620
This is a DVD.

19:03.620 --> 19:04.940
I'll find a player for it.

19:05.755 --> 19:06.880
Where is it? I'll help you.

19:08.460 --> 19:09.180
I'll get it.

19:09.380 --> 19:10.244
Let me help you.

19:12.580 --> 19:14.780
Are you fangirling or studying?

19:15.420 --> 19:16.620
Mainly studying.

19:17.260 --> 19:18.820
Body here, mind elsewhere.

19:19.888 --> 19:22.155
He Han is about
to resume updates in a few days.

19:22.300 --> 19:23.700
Gu Yan has to stay number one.

19:23.800 --> 19:25.177
Which side are you on?

19:26.700 --> 19:28.700
He Han probably
wouldn't care about this.

19:29.900 --> 19:30.540
You think so?

19:33.060 --> 19:34.100
Do you even need to ask?

19:34.100 --> 19:35.700
Once I resume, I'll top the charts.

19:35.980 --> 19:36.820
It's not that I care.

19:36.820 --> 19:38.555
It's just
that my capability is the best.

19:38.900 --> 19:39.540
That's true.

19:40.060 --> 19:41.500
Fan came to see me today.

19:41.620 --> 19:43.860
He asked me to prepare
for some promotional work.

19:44.600 --> 19:47.044
These are a few different
promotional strategies

19:47.088 --> 19:48.100
he suggested.

19:48.100 --> 19:48.580
Take a look.

19:50.755 --> 19:51.955
Which one do you want?

19:57.577 --> 19:58.755
Get straight to the point.

19:58.822 --> 20:00.410
Do we need to put together
a promotion plan

20:00.420 --> 20:02.940
for He Han's comeback?

20:05.460 --> 20:06.020
So expensive?

20:07.420 --> 20:08.980
This is how they make a living.

20:08.980 --> 20:10.260
Of course, they need to earn.

20:11.260 --> 20:13.620
But I've worked
with them for a long time.

20:14.500 --> 20:15.420
I can get a discount.

20:15.780 --> 20:17.260
I still have that kind of leverage.

20:17.860 --> 20:19.444
So tell me, how much of a discount?

20:19.860 --> 20:20.460
I'll handle it.

20:23.420 --> 20:24.580
Just a token

20:25.020 --> 20:25.900
service fee.

20:27.140 --> 20:29.300
So it really comes down to money.

20:29.660 --> 20:32.380
Well, you still have to pay something.

20:33.460 --> 20:35.100
How did Lin Zhanqiao handle it before?

20:35.100 --> 20:36.866
How would I know?
I don't deal with that.

20:37.580 --> 20:39.660
I figure once Fan leaves here,

20:39.660 --> 20:41.580
he'll turn around
and go to Lin Zhanqiao.

20:41.740 --> 20:43.180
Whatever he earns less from me,

20:43.180 --> 20:44.540
he'll find a way

20:44.540 --> 20:46.300
to make it back from her.

20:47.420 --> 20:49.100
Now that you're competing with Gu Yan,

20:49.300 --> 20:51.100
he won't miss

20:51.100 --> 20:53.500
this chance to profit off
everyone's emotions.

20:55.620 --> 20:57.500
I went to see Mr. Fan today.

20:58.740 --> 21:00.060
I wanted to talk to him

21:00.060 --> 21:02.020
about our upcoming promotion plan.

21:02.740 --> 21:04.780
But what surprised me was

21:04.844 --> 21:07.000
that he didn't try to take
advantage of me at all.

21:07.140 --> 21:07.620
And

21:07.900 --> 21:09.100
he was unusually generous.

21:09.540 --> 21:10.900
This is aged tea.

21:12.100 --> 21:14.820
A friend from the Yunnan
Tea Association gave it to me.

21:16.220 --> 21:16.660
Try it.

21:18.422 --> 21:19.977
I don't really know much about tea.

21:20.340 --> 21:22.060
He Han likes tea.
You can save it for him.

21:22.380 --> 21:23.620
Still thinking about He Han?

21:25.580 --> 21:26.355
Makes sense.

21:27.420 --> 21:28.740
Someone sentimental like you

21:29.180 --> 21:30.820
doesn't just let go that easily.

21:31.580 --> 21:32.580
What I mean is,

21:32.888 --> 21:33.740
you're close to him

21:33.940 --> 21:35.260
and to his manager.

21:37.140 --> 21:37.900
So,

21:38.020 --> 21:39.500
you have your doubts about me?

21:40.020 --> 21:42.177
You think I'd use
my position for personal gain?

21:43.580 --> 21:44.300
Between us,

21:45.300 --> 21:46.177
loyalty comes first.

21:47.060 --> 21:48.340
Look, after losing He Han,

21:48.380 --> 21:50.820
it wasn't easy for you
to build up Gu Yan.

21:51.300 --> 21:52.780
Of course, I support you.

21:53.220 --> 21:53.620
Right.

21:54.460 --> 21:55.820
That's why I came to you

21:55.820 --> 21:57.140
to ask for help.

21:57.780 --> 21:59.700
You know our company's
financial situation.

22:00.180 --> 22:02.100
And the promotional firms
partnered with Dingqi

22:02.100 --> 22:02.980
charge very high fees.

22:03.500 --> 22:04.340
For me,

22:05.900 --> 22:07.060
it's quite difficult.

22:07.060 --> 22:08.260
No, don't say any more.

22:08.980 --> 22:09.980
What I believe in

22:10.700 --> 22:11.620
is your future

22:12.700 --> 22:13.940
and Gu Yan's future.

22:14.088 --> 22:16.260
Leave the communication
with the promo company to me.

22:16.300 --> 22:18.540
I'll handle it for you.
We can talk about money later.

22:18.580 --> 22:19.100
No rush.

22:20.660 --> 22:20.940
So,

22:22.380 --> 22:23.900
Mr. Fan, you mean...

22:23.900 --> 22:25.060
We're on the same side.

22:26.500 --> 22:27.940
We fight together.

22:29.220 --> 22:30.420
If I help you save money,

22:31.020 --> 22:32.140
isn't that the same

22:32.420 --> 22:33.780
as helping myself save money?

22:36.420 --> 22:37.780
Doesn't it feel strange?

22:38.180 --> 22:40.020
All of a sudden,
he's being so attentive.

22:41.860 --> 22:43.244
Is it to get back at Dai Shan?

22:44.022 --> 22:44.900
But didn't he already

22:44.900 --> 22:46.660
let Dai Shan move into the new place?

22:49.780 --> 22:50.888
To get back at He Han?

22:53.020 --> 22:53.420
No.

22:54.820 --> 22:55.740
He's a grown man.

22:55.740 --> 22:56.860
How can he be this petty?

22:56.940 --> 22:57.780
She's his ex-wife,

22:57.910 --> 23:00.333
not his current one.
What's wrong with her dating someone?

23:00.377 --> 23:02.220
Besides, if he's capable,
he should face it openly

23:02.220 --> 23:03.300
and compete with Mr. He Han.

23:03.460 --> 23:05.488
What's the point of
stabbing someone in the back?

23:07.180 --> 23:09.220
But for us,
that's a good thing, isn't it?

23:22.066 --> 23:23.466
What are you trying to say?

23:24.620 --> 23:25.220
I mean,

23:26.380 --> 23:28.980
Ms. Lin, with He Han
being with Dai Shan,

23:28.980 --> 23:31.140
aren't you at all worried about him?

23:32.060 --> 23:34.100
I heard Dai Shan divorced Mr. Fan

23:34.460 --> 23:35.820
because she thought

23:36.540 --> 23:38.220
he couldn't earn

23:38.220 --> 23:39.100
as fast as she spent.

23:39.100 --> 23:40.711
So she went off to find someone richer.

23:41.820 --> 23:42.460
Look,

23:42.820 --> 23:44.660
now that she's with Mr. He Han,

23:45.620 --> 23:47.140
could it be that she's after his money?

23:47.660 --> 23:49.700
She'd better be after He Han's money.

23:50.555 --> 23:51.733
If we're talking about money,

23:52.020 --> 23:53.340
He Han does have some.

23:53.822 --> 23:55.511
But if you're talking
about anything else,

23:55.555 --> 23:56.555
he really doesn't.

23:56.700 --> 23:57.620
Talent.

23:57.733 --> 23:59.422
For talent, she can just do what you do

23:59.466 --> 24:00.740
and read his novels.

24:01.100 --> 24:01.580
Humor.

24:02.060 --> 24:04.460
His humor comes at your expense.

24:05.580 --> 24:07.220
Actually, he's quite nice to people.

24:13.260 --> 24:14.420
He's nice to himself.

24:17.980 --> 24:18.900
That's settled.

24:18.940 --> 24:21.088
If you don't show up for a day,
you'll get a 300-yuan penalty.

24:21.140 --> 24:21.660
Deal.

24:24.580 --> 24:27.260
You're competing with the Han.

24:27.420 --> 24:29.180
So what if you win,
and what if you lose?

24:29.820 --> 24:31.220
The key is, if you win,

24:31.333 --> 24:32.711
how much money do you actually get?

24:32.820 --> 24:34.340
It's like when we play games.

24:35.300 --> 24:36.100
We grind all day

24:36.620 --> 24:39.460
just to take first
or second place in a zone, right?

24:40.380 --> 24:41.740
This is just another kind of game.

24:42.060 --> 24:43.060
So if I win,

24:43.500 --> 24:45.220
it means I've taken the high ground.

24:45.420 --> 24:45.980
Got it.

24:46.340 --> 24:47.300
A famous author, huh?

24:47.420 --> 24:48.020
Famous

24:48.533 --> 24:49.688
online fiction author.

24:49.820 --> 24:50.860
Isn't that the same?

24:51.620 --> 24:52.540
Once you're famous,

24:52.540 --> 24:54.540
won't you have even less time
to come back here?

24:54.822 --> 24:56.333
Better if he doesn't come back.

24:56.460 --> 24:57.300
Three hundred a day.

24:57.500 --> 24:59.140
That's ten thousand a month.

24:59.620 --> 25:00.900
Three hundred a day

25:00.900 --> 25:02.340
is already being too nice to him.

25:02.620 --> 25:04.140
It should be at least five hundred.

25:04.300 --> 25:05.060
Five hundred a day, okay?

25:05.100 --> 25:06.620
Fine, five hundred a day.

25:06.688 --> 25:07.980
That's fifteen thousand a month.

25:08.580 --> 25:09.533
I'll pay twenty thousand.

25:09.660 --> 25:10.620
Twenty thousand a month.

25:10.620 --> 25:12.220
I'll still be a shareholder
of this internet cafe, right?

25:12.260 --> 25:13.980
Of course. Money talks.

25:14.220 --> 25:14.660
Greet me.

25:14.900 --> 25:15.533
Get lost.

25:21.022 --> 25:22.955
Think you're so great
just because you have money?

25:23.044 --> 25:24.355
Don't ever come back again.

25:37.660 --> 25:38.540
(Unlock password)

25:41.622 --> 25:42.460
What are you doing?

25:42.555 --> 25:43.370
(After deleting the character, all your)
There's...

25:43.380 --> 25:43.980
(equipment, silver, coins,)
What are you doing?

25:43.980 --> 25:44.740
(bound vouchers will also be deleted.)
There's no point keeping it!

25:44.740 --> 25:46.060
- Who told you to delete my account?
- There's no point!

25:46.060 --> 25:47.100
Who told you to do that?

25:47.177 --> 25:48.533
- It's useless now!
- What are you doing?

25:48.577 --> 25:49.800
What are you doing?

25:50.140 --> 25:50.900
Our situation

25:51.460 --> 25:52.820
has changed now.

25:53.180 --> 25:54.900
But you should also make some changes

25:54.900 --> 25:55.780
because of it.

25:58.820 --> 25:59.940
We haven't changed.

26:00.177 --> 26:01.540
You're the one who changed.

26:02.220 --> 26:03.380
You're Gu Yan now,

26:03.780 --> 26:04.940
not Wang Hai anymore.

26:36.066 --> 26:37.300
Given Gu Yan's current situation,

26:37.355 --> 26:38.660
let's arrange it this way for now.

26:38.700 --> 26:39.360
Mr. Fan is here.

26:40.000 --> 26:40.660
Morning, Mr. Fan.

26:40.733 --> 26:41.340
Morning, Mr. Fan.

26:41.420 --> 26:42.380
You're early, Mr. Fan.

26:42.580 --> 26:43.220
Early?

26:43.340 --> 26:44.460
Doesn't it start at nine?

26:45.866 --> 26:47.330
Those who are here,
go to the meeting room.

26:47.340 --> 26:48.977
- Alright.
- We won't wait for anyone else.

26:50.700 --> 26:52.340
(Real-time click data)

26:52.340 --> 26:53.540
(Shattered Six States, He Han,
Author Popularity Ranking No. 1)

26:53.540 --> 26:54.980
(Drunk Old Friend, Gu Yan,
Author Popularity Ranking No. 2)

26:55.020 --> 26:59.900
(First Day of Comeback)

27:14.340 --> 27:14.860
Let's begin.

27:15.333 --> 27:17.022
He Han and Gu Yan are both pushing hard.

27:17.066 --> 27:19.210
They want us to allocate
more resources to support them.

27:19.220 --> 27:19.660
Yeah.

27:19.820 --> 27:20.340
In that case,

27:20.511 --> 27:21.844
our company is stuck in a dilemma.

27:21.866 --> 27:23.550
We don't even know which side to favor.

27:23.577 --> 27:24.644
What dilemma?

27:24.900 --> 27:25.980
What's so hard about it?

27:26.900 --> 27:27.860
This is an opportunity.

27:27.900 --> 27:30.333
These two are setting up
a showdown on our platform.

27:30.540 --> 27:31.860
Tyson versus Holyfield.

27:32.220 --> 27:33.220
Why pick a side?

27:33.540 --> 27:34.980
Just stir things up.

27:35.300 --> 27:37.140
The more people buy tickets to watch,

27:37.620 --> 27:39.860
the more it benefits Dingqi.

27:40.777 --> 27:42.300
I'm monitoring things in real time.

27:42.940 --> 27:43.980
Okay, check it again.

27:44.740 --> 27:45.555
Check carefully.

27:48.133 --> 27:50.133
The data for Shattered
Six States is clearly rising.

27:50.300 --> 27:50.780
Let me see.

27:52.100 --> 27:53.260
It really is climbing fast.

28:02.044 --> 28:03.380
After all,
it's been on hiatus for a month.

28:03.380 --> 28:05.022
And now it's back
with ten chapters at once.

28:05.060 --> 28:05.920
That's a strong push.

28:05.940 --> 28:06.780
At the beginning,

28:06.780 --> 28:08.220
should we avoid the spotlight a bit?

28:08.780 --> 28:09.860
We also have extra updates.

28:11.100 --> 28:11.980
At first,

28:12.140 --> 28:13.340
He Han's side

28:13.488 --> 28:15.155
will draw more attention for sure.

28:15.180 --> 28:17.133
After all,
the return of Shattered Six States

28:17.200 --> 28:18.060
is a huge draw.

28:18.300 --> 28:19.533
Bring in all the traffic first.

28:22.260 --> 28:24.100
Dingqi said they'd handle the promotion,

28:24.100 --> 28:25.320
but there's no sign of it yet.

28:25.600 --> 28:27.060
They said it's flexible coordination,

28:27.060 --> 28:28.733
adjusting based on real-time conditions.

28:28.800 --> 28:29.777
Who's monitoring it?

28:29.980 --> 28:30.460
I am.

28:31.244 --> 28:32.600
I'll follow up on it again.

28:33.200 --> 28:35.000
- It's rising again.
- This is just the start.

28:35.111 --> 28:37.044
It'll take at least three days
to see who wins.

28:37.260 --> 28:37.980
It's rising again.

28:38.622 --> 28:40.088
(Drunk Old Friend)
This growth rate is a bit too fast.

28:40.150 --> 28:42.111
With this kind of momentum,
why wait three days?

28:44.580 --> 28:44.980
Is...

28:47.020 --> 28:48.380
Is there anything I can do to help?

29:22.060 --> 29:23.260
(Preorder Ranking)

29:23.260 --> 29:24.688
(No. 1: Shattered Six States, He Han)

29:24.711 --> 29:26.300
(No.3: Drunk Old Friend, Gu Yan)

29:29.980 --> 29:30.940
For Shattered Six States,

29:31.660 --> 29:33.466
where is the announcement
about the comeback?

29:33.511 --> 29:34.622
Why can't I see it?

29:37.300 --> 29:38.340
If I can't see it,

29:39.220 --> 29:40.980
how can readers see it?

29:42.060 --> 29:43.620
And Dai Shan and He Han?

29:43.700 --> 29:44.460
Yes, Mr. Fan.

29:44.460 --> 29:45.866
I'll arrange it right away.

29:46.740 --> 29:48.380
They paid for promotion.

29:48.420 --> 29:50.420
We need to make it visible.

29:50.500 --> 29:54.020
(He Han's Shattered Six States
resumes today!)

29:54.020 --> 29:55.180
The real-time popularity
of Shattered Six States

29:55.180 --> 29:56.220
(Author Popularity Ranking)
is about three times ours.

29:56.220 --> 29:57.620
(1. Shattered Six States, He Han
2. Drunk Old Friend, Gu Yan)

30:00.844 --> 30:01.860
That's understandable.

30:01.933 --> 30:04.220
A lot of readers here
have been waiting for the update.

30:04.288 --> 30:05.880
And many are just
watching the excitement.

30:11.577 --> 30:13.088
A top author making a strong return.

30:13.370 --> 30:15.650
Give him the top banner slot.
Wait for the right moment to act.

30:15.660 --> 30:16.260
Okay. Got it.

30:18.060 --> 30:20.060
(Shattered Six States)

30:20.060 --> 30:22.260
(Drunk Old Friend)

30:25.000 --> 30:26.800
You're really not eating anything?

30:27.380 --> 30:28.300
You eat first.

30:29.580 --> 30:32.140
Looks like tonight,
we'll have to push a bit harder.

30:33.260 --> 30:35.220
Is Lin Zhanqiao holding back

30:35.220 --> 30:37.177
and waiting
until things stabilize tomorrow

30:37.820 --> 30:39.020
to launch a strong attack?

30:41.311 --> 30:43.222
You mean adding more chapters tonight?

30:43.900 --> 30:44.980
That's brutal.

30:46.180 --> 30:46.660
Of course.

30:57.466 --> 30:58.755
He Han is adding updates.

31:03.555 --> 31:04.180
Five chapters.

31:04.180 --> 31:06.460
(Announcement: Shattered Six States
will release 5 extra chapters at 9 PM.)

31:16.355 --> 31:17.340
That's it for today.

31:17.740 --> 31:19.060
Go back and get some rest.

31:19.200 --> 31:20.020
Recharge your energy.

31:20.740 --> 31:21.620
Tomorrow at 9 AM,

31:21.644 --> 31:22.700
we make our move.

31:22.860 --> 31:24.466
- Yes, Ms. Lin.
- Yes, Ms. Lin.

31:37.940 --> 31:38.940
Go back and rest well.

31:39.500 --> 31:40.740
This may not be a real battle,

31:40.822 --> 31:42.100
but the principle is the same.

31:42.740 --> 31:44.260
The more intense the fight,

31:44.444 --> 31:46.622
the more you need
to keep your emotions in check.

31:46.740 --> 31:48.460
Who laughs last laughs best.

31:49.088 --> 31:50.577
This is only the beginning.

31:53.155 --> 31:53.977
See you.

32:15.020 --> 32:20.620
♪If the sky and the sea
turned upside down♪

32:22.540 --> 32:28.300
♪If a swimming fish
fell in love with a flying bird♪

32:29.980 --> 32:36.700
♪If back then we had never let go♪

32:37.460 --> 32:42.660
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

32:44.740 --> 32:46.860
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

32:47.100 --> 32:48.700
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

32:48.980 --> 32:51.460
♪And found our way back whole♪

32:52.220 --> 32:54.380
♪At least we still can keep♪

32:54.540 --> 32:58.740
♪This one eternal photograph♪

32:59.940 --> 33:04.740
♪But still the sky
will never turn with the sea♪

33:13.340 --> 33:13.740
Mr. Fan.

33:14.100 --> 33:14.500
Mr. Fan.

33:14.740 --> 33:15.900
The show is about to begin.

33:16.940 --> 33:17.340
Mr. Fan.

33:17.460 --> 33:17.820
Mr. Fan.

33:17.820 --> 33:18.340
Morning, Mr. Fan.

33:18.340 --> 33:21.420
(Day Two After the Comeback)

33:25.355 --> 33:27.155
(Dingqi Reading real-time data)
Chenxing has already started.

33:28.540 --> 33:30.580
On our side, the press release
has been published.

33:30.580 --> 33:31.955
I've shared it in the group.

33:32.980 --> 33:35.500
Also, the project manager
from Zhiyuan Investment came to ask

33:35.577 --> 33:36.688
whether we are confident

33:36.733 --> 33:38.466
in steadily pushing Gu Yan forward.

33:40.420 --> 33:42.140
I'm checking reader feedback.

33:42.244 --> 33:44.180
They're saying
that in He Han's latest chapters,

33:44.220 --> 33:45.380
Feng's death

33:45.540 --> 33:46.400
is too heartbreaking.

33:46.460 --> 33:47.740
We have

33:47.740 --> 33:48.980
a popular online blogger

33:48.980 --> 33:49.940
promoting it voluntarily.

33:49.980 --> 33:51.980
From the data,
the effect is quite noticeable.

33:53.860 --> 33:54.420
Let's move.

33:54.740 --> 33:55.140
Got it.

34:09.060 --> 34:10.060
Lin Zhanqiao is here.

34:11.100 --> 34:12.980
(Web fiction's tireless workhorse Gu Yan,
his hidden gem debut Drunk Old Friend)

34:24.980 --> 34:26.540
Looks like Fan hasn't kept up.

34:31.740 --> 34:32.750
Alright, I know.

34:33.060 --> 34:33.580
Okay.

34:33.580 --> 34:34.380
Thank you.

34:34.380 --> 34:35.220
Alright, that's it.

34:36.088 --> 34:37.240
How's the outsourcing company?

34:37.311 --> 34:38.260
I just got off the phone.

34:38.260 --> 34:39.660
They suggest taking it step by step.

34:39.860 --> 34:41.488
Promotion takes time to build momentum.

34:41.500 --> 34:43.060
Readers also need time to come in.

34:58.180 --> 34:59.780
I think maybe

35:00.300 --> 35:02.140
the coordination is a bit slow.

35:06.133 --> 35:07.244
Where are you going?

35:08.660 --> 35:08.980
I...

35:09.260 --> 35:10.844
I'm going to buy coffee for everyone.

35:19.820 --> 35:20.420
Hello, Mr. Fan.

35:20.660 --> 35:21.940
I'm pushing hard on my side,

35:22.044 --> 35:23.980
but the outsourcing company
is telling me to take it step by step.

35:23.980 --> 35:25.111
What does that mean?

35:25.170 --> 35:26.822
Is it because the money
hasn't come through,

35:26.844 --> 35:28.066
so they're not taking action?

35:28.460 --> 35:30.580
You told me the promotion
would be handled by you.

35:30.580 --> 35:31.900
Is this the result?

35:32.422 --> 35:33.511
If you're telling me

35:33.520 --> 35:35.060
this is because you
want to help Dai Shan,

35:35.060 --> 35:37.600
then you don't have to scheme against
me from start to finish.

35:39.140 --> 35:39.940
What happened today

35:40.300 --> 35:41.620
is just a temporary contest.

35:41.630 --> 35:42.911
People are just watching for fun.

35:42.980 --> 35:45.222
We still have a lot of
long-term cooperation ahead.

35:45.340 --> 35:47.620
If you do this, how am I supposed to
trust Dingqi anymore?

35:47.900 --> 35:48.580
Are you done?

35:49.020 --> 35:50.580
Why are you so impatient?

35:51.511 --> 35:53.755
Let's look at
the results after three days.

35:53.860 --> 35:55.700
It's only the first day.

35:56.420 --> 35:57.660
We just wanted

35:57.740 --> 35:59.311
to see how strong the pull is

35:59.333 --> 36:01.140
without any major promotional push,

36:01.260 --> 36:03.580
and then strike later with precision.

36:03.700 --> 36:05.220
You've seen the current situation.

36:05.620 --> 36:07.980
He Han and Dai Shan's side
is coming in strong.

36:09.380 --> 36:10.780
Let me just say one more thing.

36:10.844 --> 36:12.822
I'm not someone who loses
judgment over relationships.

36:17.620 --> 36:18.020
Mr. Fan,

36:18.066 --> 36:19.777
should we release Gu Yan's promo slots

36:19.800 --> 36:21.311
and recommended content now?

36:23.133 --> 36:24.066
Wait a bit longer.

36:24.355 --> 36:25.444
Help when it's most needed.

36:25.511 --> 36:26.790
Let the storm grow stronger first.

36:26.900 --> 36:27.844
Alright, understood.

36:40.660 --> 36:43.340
(Shattered Six States:
No. 1, Drunk Old Friend: No. 2)

36:43.340 --> 36:44.580
Lin Zhanqiao can't handle this.

36:46.020 --> 36:47.980
If she really makes
a name for herself today,

36:47.980 --> 36:49.340
it'll be hard to deal with later.

36:50.060 --> 36:50.900
It's a pity, though.

36:50.900 --> 36:52.980
This is just a battle for pride.

36:53.180 --> 36:54.620
Even if you win, it's only for face.

36:54.700 --> 36:55.740
You won't earn much money.

36:56.020 --> 36:57.180
Reputation is money.

36:57.600 --> 36:59.311
I'll go encourage my ex-girlfriend.

37:19.911 --> 37:22.088
Didn't Gu Yan go out to
buy coffee for everyone?

37:23.020 --> 37:24.180
I think he was too nervous,

37:24.180 --> 37:25.300
so he went out for coffee.

37:26.780 --> 37:28.100
If I were him, I'd be nervous, too.

37:28.140 --> 37:29.460
This is a battle for reputation.

37:29.540 --> 37:30.500
Win, and you rise overnight.

37:30.500 --> 37:33.466
Lose, and you're stuck as second best
and your value drops.

37:34.220 --> 37:34.980
Tell me,

37:35.020 --> 37:36.580
wouldn't the adaptation rights

37:36.590 --> 37:38.022
be worth at least ten times different?

37:38.088 --> 37:39.020
Not just that.

37:39.060 --> 37:40.460
He'll become the author of the year.

37:40.460 --> 37:41.500
A direct slap to He Han.

37:41.711 --> 37:43.133
Tell me, is that big news or not?

38:05.340 --> 38:06.380
Gu Yan or He Han,

38:07.620 --> 38:09.180
or rather Lin Zhanqiao or He Han,

38:09.180 --> 38:10.200
who do you want to win?

38:10.260 --> 38:11.800
I know what you're going to say.

38:12.620 --> 38:14.380
Whether it's Gu Yan or He Han,

38:15.300 --> 38:16.860
it's still you losing to Lin Zhanqiao.

38:17.100 --> 38:18.220
We're a new company.

38:18.220 --> 38:19.020
So what?

38:20.060 --> 38:21.260
Don't leave me as a bystander.

38:21.260 --> 38:23.866
Give me something to work
with so I can engage the investors.

38:24.980 --> 38:27.020
In the future, these two
won't be our rivals.

38:27.180 --> 38:28.140
Forget the future.

38:28.980 --> 38:29.500
I mean now.

38:33.420 --> 38:34.820
If I have to choose one,

38:35.644 --> 38:36.844
I'll choose Gu Yan.

38:43.220 --> 38:43.660
Why?

38:44.755 --> 38:46.488
He Han is performing better now, no?

38:47.260 --> 38:48.340
He's too tough

38:48.540 --> 38:49.220
to handle.

38:49.860 --> 38:50.580
But Gu Yan,

38:51.422 --> 38:52.844
I might be able to work with him.

38:55.540 --> 38:56.140
That's enough.

38:58.500 --> 38:59.860
Both sides matter to us.

39:00.580 --> 39:01.940
They're both our top authors.

39:01.940 --> 39:04.155
We have to give each
of them some incentives, right?

39:04.420 --> 39:05.180
So now,

39:05.288 --> 39:07.555
I'll have the outsourcing
company promote Drunk Old Friend.

39:07.660 --> 39:08.311
That's fine.

39:08.900 --> 39:09.980
Just keep it steady.

39:24.500 --> 39:26.700
(Web fiction's tireless workhorse Gu Yan,
his hidden gem debut Drunk Old Friend)

39:31.020 --> 39:33.340
From this data,
the numbers match.

39:33.644 --> 39:34.740
Push for faster updates.

39:37.260 --> 39:37.980
This is great.

39:38.500 --> 39:39.740
They finally started working.

39:41.540 --> 39:41.980
Look,

39:42.333 --> 39:43.200
not bad, right?

39:43.822 --> 39:44.660
This is real time.

39:45.700 --> 39:46.180
Looks good.

39:47.220 --> 39:48.020
They've started.

39:48.300 --> 39:48.700
Ms. Lin,

39:50.300 --> 39:52.580
Dingqi has now given us
the main promotion slots.

39:53.066 --> 39:54.130
How's Shattered Six States?

39:54.140 --> 39:55.340
On the male channel homepage,

39:55.340 --> 39:56.844
Shattered Six States
still has the advantage.

39:56.955 --> 39:58.222
The outsourcing company said

39:58.500 --> 39:59.977
they've also pushed it on WeChat.

40:09.140 --> 40:11.980
(Drunk Old Friend)

40:17.140 --> 40:18.844
(Today's Recommendation:
Drunk Old Friend)

40:18.911 --> 40:20.660
(Drunk Old Friend: ongoing,
Author: Gu Yan)

40:21.700 --> 40:22.444
I'll leave.

40:22.740 --> 40:23.300
Wait a moment.

40:24.333 --> 40:26.300
Don't worry,
I'll choose my words carefully.

40:26.460 --> 40:28.022
A lot of comfort, a little pride,

40:28.030 --> 40:29.200
and just a touch of sarcasm.

40:29.311 --> 40:30.577
Maybe we celebrated too early.

40:33.980 --> 40:35.100
Drunk Old Friend

40:35.244 --> 40:36.622
is surging in popularity.

40:42.020 --> 40:45.060
(Shattered Six States:
No. 1, Drunk Old Friend: No. 2)

40:48.540 --> 40:50.220
Our readership is still much higher.

40:50.220 --> 40:51.460
At this rate,

40:52.355 --> 40:54.133
it may be hard to tell by tomorrow.

40:54.460 --> 40:55.500
No way.

40:57.020 --> 40:57.700
Fan, come,

40:57.700 --> 40:58.860
explain what's going on.

40:59.460 --> 41:01.100
I really didn't expect this.

41:01.900 --> 41:03.220
I didn't expect she'd go all out

41:03.220 --> 41:04.260
for Gu Yan like this.

41:04.740 --> 41:05.620
Originally, I thought

41:06.380 --> 41:08.340
that with the promotion package
you bought,

41:08.340 --> 41:09.460
it would be more than enough.

41:09.660 --> 41:12.100
Plus, He Han still has
his core base supporting him.

41:12.980 --> 41:13.820
And Lin Zhanqiao

41:14.140 --> 41:16.020
doesn't have much money right now.

41:16.580 --> 41:17.860
Who knew she'd go all in

41:17.860 --> 41:18.780
regardless of cost?

41:20.060 --> 41:20.500
Look,

41:20.755 --> 41:23.100
there's no such thing
as second place in writing contests.

41:23.220 --> 41:24.340
That so-called showdown

41:24.340 --> 41:25.820
is just hype.

41:26.140 --> 41:27.500
After all, he's just

41:27.500 --> 41:28.580
a newly rising author.

41:28.733 --> 41:29.990
No need to take it so seriously.

41:30.060 --> 41:31.780
You should talk to He Han, alright?

41:33.088 --> 41:34.260
I still have things to handle.

41:34.333 --> 41:35.260
I'll get back to work.

41:35.380 --> 41:36.111
That's it.

41:49.620 --> 41:53.140
(Top Sales Ranking. Drunk Old Friend:
No.1, Shattered Six States: No. 2)

42:01.260 --> 42:04.500
♪I watch the stars in my eyes♪

42:04.820 --> 42:07.620
♪Slowly drift away♪

42:09.540 --> 42:12.180
♪Died a little inside last night♪

42:12.460 --> 42:15.540
♪Cause I'll never see you again♪

42:17.300 --> 42:20.460
♪I'm waking up to silence around me♪

42:22.020 --> 42:23.540
(When we say we care,)

42:24.340 --> 42:25.540
(maybe we truly do,)

42:26.420 --> 42:28.020
(or maybe we don't that much.)

42:29.422 --> 42:30.777
(By the same token,)

42:31.580 --> 42:33.580
(when we act like we don't care at all,)

42:34.500 --> 42:36.500
(it might actually be
because we care too much.)

42:37.933 --> 42:39.140
(About winning and losing.)

42:39.140 --> 42:40.340
(Ranking. Drunk Old Friend: No. 1,
Shattered Six States: No. 2)

42:40.340 --> 42:41.300
(About gains and losses.)

42:42.420 --> 42:43.620
(About the past and the future.)

42:44.940 --> 42:46.340
(And about the people and things)

42:48.220 --> 42:49.100
(we love deeply.)

42:49.660 --> 42:52.300
♪Through the sleepless nights♪

42:52.540 --> 42:55.900
♪All I think about is you♪

42:56.540 --> 42:57.500
♪How I wish♪

42:57.500 --> 43:00.300
♪That you could hear my voice♪

43:00.540 --> 43:04.540
♪And know I won't forget you♪

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
